  sumEn="The first steam locomotive ran on rails at Merthyr. The first passenger railway ran at Swansea. Welsh iron made the world’s rails, Welsh coal drove its ships, Welsh slate roofed its cities, and the first cheque for a million pounds was signed in Cardiff.",
